            "algebra"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "step-1-2",
          "claim": "For any $a\\in\\mathbb R^d$, $\\|aa^T\\|_F^2=\\sum_{r,s}(a_ra_s)^2=(\\sum_r a_r^2)^2$, so $\\|C_{ij}\\|_F=\\|x_i-x_j\\|_2^2$ by [F5]. By [F4], $\\|D_{ijl}\\|_F\\le\\|C_{ij}\\|_F+\\|C_{il}\\|_F=\\|x_i-x_j\\|_2^2+\\|x_i-x_l\\|_2^2$.",
          "step": "1.2",
          "inputs": [
